#api call for create user account
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/foods/signup/
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "username":"user3",
   "email":"user3@gmail.com",
   "password":"Password@123"
}

#api call for generate token
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/foods/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username":"user",
  "password":"Password@123"
}
#api call for get current user
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/foods/me/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Token f0a449fefb1dfc6e28382de24baf3f1bda7849e3


#Foodlog end points

#api call for list foodlogs
###
